      "index": "a1",
      "text": "Legend: grey hatched = out-of-date data · colours: see the key above (always with a word) · blue button = primary action · dashed line on a phone = end of first screen · dashed grey boxes = annotations · problems use incident status, repairs use repair status (separate sets) Updated 2026-11-03 from stale-decisions-2026-11-03.md (manual dangerous repairs, Orvex-only information, approval validity, settings channels and policy).",
      "originalText": "Legend: grey hatched = out-of-date data · colours: see the key above (always with a word) · blue button = primary action · dashed line on a phone = end of first screen · dashed grey boxes = annotations · problems use incident status, repairs use repair status (separate sets) Updated 2026-11-03 from stale-decisions-2026-11-03.md (manual dangerous repairs, Orvex-only information, approval validity, settings channels and policy).",
