      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793720963503,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b4T",
      "text": "Every repair shows its repair-status steps (Waiting for approval →\nRunning → Verifying → Succeeded / Failed) and who permitted it (FR-33,\nFR-34). Ticked repairs skip the approval step. Also Rejected, Blocked,\nCancelled, Expired. Notes such as “undone” or “made things worse” sit\nnext to Failed (Amine). Manual (dangerous) repairs show Manual repair\nneeded → Verifying → Succeeded / Failed, with who performed it and that\nNightshift checked it (FR-52). Permission sources: ticked in your\nsettings · agreed management policy (version) · approved at the time (by\nwhom, when, on whose behalf) · last-resort condition (FR-51).\nPlaceholder data.",
      "originalText": "Every repair shows its repair-status steps (Waiting for approval →\nRunning → Verifying → Succeeded / Failed) and who permitted it (FR-33,\nFR-34). Ticked repairs skip the approval step. Also Rejected, Blocked,\nCancelled, Expired. Notes such as “undone” or “made things worse” sit\nnext to Failed (Amine). Manual (dangerous) repairs show Manual repair\nneeded → Verifying → Succeeded / Failed, with who performed it and that\nNightshift checked it (FR-52). Permission sources: ticked in your\nsettings · agreed management policy (version) · approved at the time (by\nwhom, when, on whose behalf) · last-resort condition (FR-51).\nPlaceholder data.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
